cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you refer to this work, please cite it as below.
title: Small-Object Detection on Drone Imagery
abstract: >-
  YOLO11n trained and evaluated on VisDrone2019, exported to ONNX and profiled
  across backends, with a tracking pipeline and measured accuracy/latency
  trade-offs. The code is MIT; the published weights, and any ONNX export of
  them, are AGPL-3.0, because they are fine-tuned from an
  Ultralytics checkpoint. VisDrone2019 is copyright the AISKYEYE team at
  Tianjin University and is not redistributed here. See NOTICE.
authors:
  - family-names: Jiang
    given-names: Feng
repository-code: https://github.com/Kenchch/aerial-small-object-detection
license:
  - MIT
  - AGPL-3.0-only
